---
import './_screenshot.scss';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
	<meta charset='UTF-8' />
	<meta name='robots' content='noindex' />
	<title>Screenshot 5 — Packed with Power</title>
</head>
<body>
	<div class='canvas'>
		<div class='bottom-glow'></div>
		<div class='over-glow'></div>

		<div class='s5-wrap'>
			<h1 class='headline' style='padding-top:0;'>Packed with Power<span class='dot'>.</span></h1>

			<div class='s5-grid'>

				<div class='s5-feat'>
					<svg class='s5-icon' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='currentColor'>
						<path d='M13 2L4.09 12.97H11L10 22L20.09 11.03H13L13 2Z'/>
					</svg>
					<div class='s5-feat-title'>PowerScore Algorithm</div>
					<div class='s5-feat-desc'>Every live game gets a 0–100 score built from five signals: closeness, late-game pressure, momentum, lead changes, and comeback factor. The most exciting game is always on screen.</div>
				</div>

				<div class='s5-feat'>
					<svg class='s5-icon' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.75' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'>
						<circle cx='12' cy='12' r='10'/>
						<ellipse cx='12' cy='12' rx='4' ry='10'/>
						<line x1='2' y1='12' x2='22' y2='12'/>
						<path d='M3.5 7.5 Q12 10 20.5 7.5'/>
						<path d='M3.5 16.5 Q12 14 20.5 16.5'/>
					</svg>
					<div class='s5-feat-title'>31 Leagues</div>
					<div class='s5-feat-desc'>NBA, NFL, NHL, MLB, MLS, Premier League, Champions League, and 24 more. Toggle any sport on or off, so you only monitor the leagues you actually watch.</div>
				</div>

				<div class='s5-feat'>
					<svg class='s5-icon' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.75' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'>
						<rect x='2' y='3' width='20' height='14' rx='2'/>
						<line x1='8' y1='21' x2='16' y2='21'/>
						<line x1='12' y1='17' x2='12' y2='21'/>
						<path d='M8 10 L11 8 L11 12 Z' fill='currentColor' stroke='none'/>
						<path d='M13 9.5 C14.5 9 16.5 10 16.5 12 C16.5 14 14.5 15 13 14.5'/>
					</svg>
					<div class='s5-feat-title'>Standby Stream</div>
					<div class='s5-feat-desc'>When all live games go cold — halftime everywhere, blowouts across the board — ArenaSwap falls back to your designated standby tab automatically. Never stare at dead air again.</div>
				</div>

				<div class='s5-feat'>
					<svg class='s5-icon' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.75' stroke-linecap='round'>
						<line x1='2' y1='7' x2='22' y2='7'/>
						<circle cx='7' cy='7' r='3'/>
						<line x1='2' y1='17' x2='22' y2='17'/>
						<circle cx='17' cy='17' r='3'/>
					</svg>
					<div class='s5-feat-title'>Built to Your Taste</div>
					<div class='s5-feat-desc'>Set sensitivity, switch cooldown, switch delay, per-league favorite team bonuses, and per-game boosts. Dial ArenaSwap in until it switches exactly the way you want it to.</div>
				</div>

				<div class='s5-feat'>
					<svg class='s5-icon' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.75' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'>
						<polyline points='3 20 7 13 11 15.5 15 7 19 11 21 6'/>
						<line x1='3' y1='3' x2='3' y2='20'/>
						<line x1='3' y1='20' x2='21' y2='20'/>
						<circle cx='15' cy='7' r='2' fill='currentColor' stroke='none'/>
					</svg>
					<div class='s5-feat-title'>Live Game Charts</div>
					<div class='s5-feat-desc'>Tap any game for the full analytics view: PowerScore over time, score margin, team scoring history, and live signal breakdowns. See exactly why ArenaSwap picked that game.</div>
				</div>

				<div class='s5-feat'>
					<svg class='s5-icon' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.75' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'>
						<path d='M12 2 L20 5.5 L20 13 C20 17.5 16.5 21 12 22 C7.5 21 4 17.5 4 13 L4 5.5 Z'/>
						<polyline points='8 12 11 15 16 9'/>
					</svg>
					<div class='s5-feat-title'>Private by Default</div>
					<div class='s5-feat-desc'>No account. No login. No subscription. No tracking. Scores come directly from ESPN's public API. Everything else runs locally in your browser. 100% free and open source — forever.</div>
				</div>

			</div>

		</div>
	</div>

	<style>
		.s5-wrap {
			position: relative;
			z-index: 2;
			width: 1280px;
			height: 800px;
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			align-items: center;
			padding: 48px 96px 44px;
		}

		.s5-grid {
			flex: 1;
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
			column-gap: 52px;
			width: 100%;
			align-content: center;
		}

		.s5-feat {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			align-items: flex-start;
			padding: 11px 0;
		}

		.s5-icon {
			width: 28px;
			height: 28px;
			color: #F75C03;
			margin-bottom: 12px;
			flex-shrink: 0;
		}

		.s5-feat-title {
			font-size: 1.3rem;
			font-weight: 700;
			color: #e6edf3;
			margin-bottom: 6px;
			letter-spacing: -0.02em;
			line-height: 1.2;
		}

		.s5-feat-desc {
			font-size: 1rem;
			color: rgba(230, 237, 243, 0.55);
			line-height: 1.6;
		}

	</style>
</body>
</html>
